      "description": "Just like Sarah and Matteo, we love our pets so we only give them the GOODEST! 🧡\n\nTry 3 APPETIZING FLAVORS: Beef and Liver Steak, Grilled Chicken and Liver, and Braised Beef with Veggies -- your dog will surely be wagging their tails for more! Available in 80G and 130G Pouches.\n\n✅ MADE WITH REAL MEAT, a source of high quality protein for your dogs!\n✅ COMPLETE & BALANCED NUTRITION meeting AAFCO* Standards.\n✅ LOW IN SODIUM to support urinary health\n✅ VET-FORMULATED FOR ALL LIFESTAGES, ensuring optimum nutrition for puppies, adult, and senior dogs!\n✅ ENRICHED WITH ESSENTIAL NUTRIENTS: calcium, sodium, zinc, Vitamins A & E. These nutrients support (1) healthy skin, (2) shiny coat, (3) sharp eyesight, and (4) a strong immune system.\n\nGive your dog the AffordaGOODEST nutrition they deserve, arf! 🐶\n\n*AAFCO stands for the Association of American Feed Control Officials that set a standard for pet food with clear guidelines on what nutrients pets need to stay healthy across different lifestages.\n\nBureau Of Animal Industry (BAl) - Certificate of Feed Product Registration (CFPR): Beef and Liver (SF-DFL1-23-5155462809), Grilled Chicken and Liver (SF-DFL1-23-5155562810) and Braised Beef with Veggies (SF-DFL1-23-5155562817).\n\n",
