    "product_description": {
      "paragraph_list": [
        {
          "text": "Just like Sarah and Matteo, we love our pets so we only give them the GOODEST! 🧡",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Try 3 APPETIZING FLAVORS: Beef and Liver Steak, Grilled Chicken and Liver, and Braised Beef with Veggies -- your dog will surely be wagging their tails for more! Available in 80G and 130G Pouches.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "✅ MADE WITH REAL MEAT, a source of high quality protein for your dogs!",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "✅ COMPLETE & BALANCED NUTRITION meeting AAFCO* Standards.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "✅ LOW IN SODIUM to support urinary health",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "✅ VET-FORMULATED FOR ALL LIFESTAGES, ensuring optimum nutrition for puppies, adult, and senior dogs!",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "✅ ENRICHED WITH ESSENTIAL NUTRIENTS: calcium, sodium, zinc, Vitamins A & E. These nutrients support (1) healthy skin, (2) shiny coat, (3) sharp eyesight, and (4) a strong immune system.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Give your dog the AffordaGOODEST nutrition they deserve, arf! 🐶",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "*AAFCO stands for the Association of American Feed Control Officials that set a standard for pet food with clear guidelines on what nutrients pets need to stay healthy across different lifestages.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
